er control here  yes overall these measures may have an  effect but unfortunately they come far  too late the pandemic hit germany with  full force in southern germany as i said  and other  regions we have exorbitantly high  numbers of infections due to low  vaccination rates and intensive care  medicine is at the limit of its capacity  therefore in addition to these measures  we have to intensify the vaccinations as  much as possible but above all the  booster vaccinations and unfortunately  the vaccination centers were closed even  though the development was foreseeable  now we are chasing after things  all right dr uber janssen with the  german society for internal intensive  care and emergency medicine thanks very  much for your time  thank you

